# Admin platform safety

- **Site Changes** stays available in the admin desk. Use `assessSiteChangeMessage()` in `src/lib/site-change-risk.ts` to show warnings (and confirm before send) when a request touches hosting, secrets, Git, DNS, auth, or bulk jobs — do not hard-disable the menu unless the user explicitly asks.
- **Aggregation import/sync/prune** from admin browser — still gated by `SEAPS_ENABLE_ADMIN_AGGREGATION_CONTROL` (default off).

Public canonical domain is **https://www.seaps.asia** (`NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`). Do not default new links to `vps1.store`.

When adding new admin APIs that mutate global infrastructure, prefer env gates or explicit developer-only paths.
